  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, the My Worlds -> Recently Visited menu lists the last 20 places we've been to. As a frequent world hopper, sometimes we want to show a world we've been to previously to another group; and if we forget it's name, there really isn't a good way to recall.\n\nThe suggestion here is super simple: increase the maximum size from 20 to 64-72; this would catch anything that happened recently.\n\nThank you!",
